    "814 N 2nd St, Phoenix, AZ",
    "Book a free, 45-minute private tour at any showroom café. A specialist walks you through the Atelier line, dials a shot to your taste, and answers everything a spec sheet can't. No obligation to buy.",
    "→45 minutes, one-to-one with a specialist",
    "→Taste the full range, dialled to your palate",
    "→Free, and yours to book whenever suits",
    "We'll confirm by email within one business day. No payment needed to book.",
    "No appointment, no pressure — just a good cup and a warm room. We'd love to see you.",
    "Warm mornings, made effortless. Coffee, tea, and cold-pressed juice, and the machines that make them sing.",
    "© 2026 Fréscopa · Privacy · Terms · A fictional brand, created for demonstration."
